{"sourceSha256": "c5a5b2160d43b54806baad0a3679cdf0c3eada1747a893ea65eaa71208e7aafe", "text": "31/12/13\n\nExamination:\n\nD1/14\n\nJoshua Vance\nMale\nWANS\n\nNormal vagina! delivery at 38 weeks’ gestation\nNo perinatal or neonatal complications\n\nBirth weight 32509\n\nPamela Vance (mother) — first child\nStewart Vance (father)\n\nRoutine 6-week baby check\n\nMother concerned regarding bowel actions: only one bowel action every 3 days:\nstools a litte hard. '/s breastfed. Making wet nappies, feeding well, demanc\n\nfeeding, sleeping through the night\n\n€@-waek check -- good tone, hands & feet normal, hips normal, genitalia male, re\nhemiae. no evidence of spina bifida occulta, abdominal/chest/heart exam norm\n\nfontanelles normal, red ratlex present, nose & ears normal, palate imtact Penan\nexamination normal, oo fissures, Weight 39009\n\nMilc constipation in breastfed baby, otherwise normal 6-week check\nReassurance — bowel habrt variable in infants & can often settle. Try expressing\nmilk from one feed a day & giving it in a bottle with some water (boiled & cooled\n\nto body temp)\nRewew 2/52\n\nStill hard stools every 3 days. Now waking up crying, pulling legs Up to chest\nevery half hour throughout the night. Puils away from breast nalfway through\n\nfeeds, No vomiting. No fevers. No respiratory symptoms Making wet nappies.\n\nHydration status normal,\nAbdominal examination: hard faeces.\nPerianal examination normal, no fissures\n\nWeight 4200g.\nConstipation no better. Has put on weight.\n\nTria! of Coloxy! drops daily. Express milk from two feeds a day & give it in a bot\nwith some water (Dolled & cooled to body tamp)\n\nReview 1/52.\n4cCA", "pages": [{"number": 1, "text": "31/12/13\n\nExamination:\n\nD1/14\n\nJoshua Vance\nMale\nWANS\n\nNormal vagina! delivery at 38 weeks’ gestation\nNo perinatal or neonatal complications\n\nBirth weight 32509\n\nPamela Vance (mother) — first child\nStewart Vance (father)\n\nRoutine 6-week baby check\n\nMother concerned reg